### KOLEKSIKITA API TESTS
### Membutuhkan extension "REST Client" di VS Code untuk menjalankannya.
### Atau bisa di-import ke Postman / ThunderClient.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api/v1
# Ganti dengan token yang didapat setelah login
@token = paste_your_token_here

### ----------------------------------------------------
### 1. PUBLIC ENDPOINTS (Tanpa Auth)
### ----------------------------------------------------

### Cek Kesehatan Server
GET http://localhost:3001/health

### Get Semua Kategori Aktif
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories

### Get Kategori Spesifik (Slug)
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/sepatu-sneakers

### Get Semua Produk (Dengan pagination & pencarian)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?page=1&per_page=10&search=Nike&sort=newest

### Get Semua Produk Unggulan (Featured)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?featured=true

### ----------------------------------------------------
### 2. AUTHENTICATION
### ----------------------------------------------------

### Login Admin
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@koleksikita.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Cek Data Diri
# Cookie akan otomatis dikirim jika menggunakan REST Client yang mendukung cookie jar
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout

### ----------------------------------------------------
### 3. ADMIN ENDPOINTS (Wajib Cookie Aktif)
### ----------------------------------------------------

### Buat Kategori Baru
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Aksesoris Tambahan",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### Buat Produk Baru
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kacamata Hitam Anti Silau",
  "category_id": "c1a2b3c4-d5e6-7f8a-9b0c-1d2e3f4a5b6c", 
  "price": 150000,
  "image": "https://example.com/image.jpg",
  "affiliate_url": "https://shopee.co.id/product",
  "marketplace_type": "shopee",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}
